extends layout

block content
  .row.banner
    .col-12
      h1 MEAN Full Stack Final Project
  .row
    .col-12.col-lg-9
      .row
        .col-12.col-md-12 
          h3.rating Overall Rating:  
            i.fas.fa-star
            i.fas.fa-star
            i.fas.fa-star
            i.far.fa-star
            i.far.fa-star 
            <br><br>
          .card.card-primary
            .card-block
              h2.card-title Project Characteristics
              span.badge.badge-warning
                i.fa.fa-check
                | &nbsp;Solo Project
              | &nbsp;
              span.badge.badge-warning
                i.fa.fa-check
                | &nbsp;Computer Science
              | &nbsp;
              span.badge.badge-warning
                i.fa.fa-check
                | &nbsp;Final
              | &nbsp;
          .card.card-primary
            .card-block
              h2
                a(href='/evaluation/demographics/new') Project Demographics:
              p.card-text Group Project Members:
                .col-12
                  p.demographic This individual was by themselves
              p.card-text Today's Date: 
                .col-12
                  p.demographic 4/26/2024
              p.card-text Evaluator's Name:
                .col-12
                  p.demographic Professor John Snow
              p.card-text Title of Evaluation:
                .col-12
                  p.demographic Evaluation Tool: the app
          .card.card-primary
            .card-block
              h2
                a(href='/evaluation/content/new') Project Content:
              p.card-text Introduction:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Organization Of Content:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Time Frame:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Visual Aid:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Knowledge and Preparation:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
          .card.card-primary
            .card-block
              h2
                a(href='/evaluation/skills/new') Verbal Skills:
              p.card-text Enthusiasm and Motivation:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Elocution:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Vocal Pauses:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
          .card.card-primary
            .card-block
              h2
                 a(href='/evaluation/nonverbal/new') Non-verbal Skills:
              p.card-text Eye Contact:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
              p.card-text Gestures:  
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.fas.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
                i.far.fa-star
      .row
        .col-12
          .card.card-primary.review-card
            .card-block
              a.btn.btn-primary.float-right(href='/evaluation/comment/new') Add comment
              h2.card-title Past comments
              .row.review
                .col-12.no-gutters.review-header
                  span.rating
                    i.fas.fa-star
                    i.fas.fa-star
                    i.fas.fa-star
                    i.far.fa-star
                    i.far.fa-star
                  span.reviewAuthor John Smith
                  small.reviewTimestamp 16 April 2024
                .col-12
                  p Overall great presentation, a couple issues but nothing horrible.
              .row.review
                .col-12.no-gutters.review-header
                  span.rating
                    i.fas.fa-star
                    i.fas.fa-star
                    i.fas.fa-star
                    i.far.fa-star
                    i.far.fa-star
                  span.reviewAuthor Jane Doe
                  small.reviewTimestamp 16 April 2024
                .col-12
                  p It was okay. The verbal cues need work, but the content was good.
    .col-12.col-lg-3
      p.lead
        | This MEAN Full Stack Project was a final project for the class CS 5780. They were tasked with create another version of the semester project Loc8r.
      p
        | If you have any comments or suggestions please leave a comment to help the presenter.